{"id":"07cc8c9f85071f9c","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-topo9-extent.md","title":"ZFC Topo9 Extent","display":"df-zfc-topo9-extent — ZFC Topo9 Extent","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo9-extent","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo9-extent"],"display":"df-zfc-topo9-extent — ZFC Topo9 Extent","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-top6-discrete-space]]","[[58-df-cardinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo9-extent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo9-extent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo9-extent — ZFC Topo9 Extent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" href=\"?note=4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f2805f16c0c15af5\" href=\"?note=f2805f16c0c15af5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top6-discrete-space\">58-df-zfc-top6-discrete-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,X,\\tau,D\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,X,\\tau,D\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (topological-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (closed-set predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop6DiscreteSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop6DiscreteSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (discrete-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|D|\">\\(|D|\\)</span> (cardinality)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Extent}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Extent}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (extent-value predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}extent} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Extent}_S(\\kappa,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\kappa=\\bigcup\\left\\{|D|:D\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,D)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop6DiscreteSpace}_S\\!\\left(D,\\{D\\cap U:U\\in\\tau\\}\\right)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}extent} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Extent}_S(\\kappa,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\kappa=\\bigcup\\left\\{|D|:D\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,D)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop6DiscreteSpace}_S\\!\\left(D,\\{D\\cap U:U\\in\\tau\\}\\right)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The extent is represented relationally by its value <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>; the induced topology is expanded in the assertion, so closed discreteness does not depend on an undeclared restriction operator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set","status":"resolved","id":"4dc8b2d2e69010a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top6-discrete-space","status":"resolved","id":"f2805f16c0c15af5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top6-discrete-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinality]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,X,\\tau,D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop6DiscreteSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"|D|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Extent}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}extent} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Extent}_S(\\kappa,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\kappa=\\bigcup\\left\\{|D|:D\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,D)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop6DiscreteSpace}_S\\!\\left(D,\\{D\\cap U:U\\in\\tau\\}\\right)\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1318,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3729","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-topo9-extent.md|58-df-zfc-topo9-extent]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","74086485fba8d86f","4dc8b2d2e69010a2","f2805f16c0c15af5","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}